rained maximisation, $D^2_{xx}L(x^\\ast,\\mu^\\ast)$ is negative definite on all of $\\mathbb{R}^n$. What can be concluded?","options":["A strict local maximiser: definiteness on $\\mathbb{R}^n$ covers the tangent space","Nothing until the bordered minors are computed","A strict local maximiser only if $D^2f(x^\\ast)$ is negative definite too","A strict global maximiser on the feasible set"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"7d38a03d31fa56886eb86e9e","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"replaced_after_academic_review"}]}}